# Git and PR attribution

When creating commits or pull requests for this repository:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any Cursor/agent co-author trailer).
- Do **not** add "Made with Cursor" or similar attribution in commit messages or PR descriptions.
- Use semantic commit messages and human-readable PR text only.

If the user asks you to commit or open a PR, verify the commit message body has no agent attribution before finishing.
